0x4C03735B  TgVoiceDampA2           ; (d0 slot) r0 := 0xA280, r1 := 0xA200 only -- the rate-0xA2 damp ramp
0x4C037360  TgVoiceDampA2_entry
0x4C037A34  TgVoiceReg0401Write     ; (d0 slot, d1 value) librec 0x500CA0B0+slot*0x84 +0x28 halfword: low 14 bits := value (bits 15..14 kept), then TgVoiceRegWrite_entry(slot, class 0x0401, new halfword) -- the live EG-time write the scale-B refreshes use
