; ---- named-only satellites of the 2026-07-20 pass --------------------------
0x4C00FBCA  TgPartClassRegCollect   ; (d0 part, d1 mask, stack sel) build the -1-terminated list 0x500C9848 of the part's cached class-register halfwords (table 0x500C59E4+part*0x36, 0x1B entries) whose tag byte ROM 0x485870F0[i] & ~sel matches mask; each entry = tag<<16 | halfword; returns a0 = list -- the reg enumerator behind the EG-ramp live refreshes
