;      Sum resolvers: value halfwords partrec+0x66+dest*0xC+i*2, depths
;      +0x6C+dest*0xC+i*2, route/sign mask bytes partrec+0x53A+bank*4;
;      each sibling owns one dest-enable bit (0x02..0x40) ------------------
