; ---- the TG-present STRAP PROBE read by TgChipResetSideA/B (2026-07-20)
0x484D7713  TgStrapProbe            ; -> 3 when 0x98070000 bit 0x02 is CLEAR ("no TG": the caller leaves the TG-enable gate 0x500CE380 at 0x7F and every register writer stays a no-op), else 2 when bit 0x04 is clear, else 1. NOTE the bits are 0x02/0x04 of the halfword -- earlier notes said "bit1/bit2"
