0x484D773A  TgStrapProbeSideB       ; -> 2 when 0x98070000 bit 0x01 is clear, else 1 -- the second strap line

; ---- the AUX-RECORD FIELD ACCESSORS (2026-07-20): the leaf get/set pairs the
;      SOUND EDIT layer uses on the aux record 0x500BDB04+idx*0x2C8. Names carry
;      the field's byte offset: Hdr<NN> = header +0xNN, Mod<NN> = mod-unit
;      +0x54+unit*0x7A, +0xNN. The ranged fields are driven by the offset
;      applier 0x4C00A820 (read field, add a signed delta, clamp through
;      0x4C00A7BE to +/-0x64 or +/-0x7F, write back).
